AI
==

Small proofs of concept while reading about artificial intelligence.
One directory per idea, each with the algorithm and a test that runs it,
nothing shared between them on purpose: they are meant to be read one at
a time.

Python needs nothing but the standard library, the C++ ones only a
compiler and make.

    python test_<name>.py     in a python directory
    make && ./<name>_test     in a c++ directory
